{"unit_id":"lifefloating__dsh-doudizhu#feature-feature-1","repo":"lifefloating/dsh-doudizhu","commit":"06dab1c528542f92f63a6733806f03877f33293f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-poker 的「创建和加入房间」功能：在 DSH Web 的侧栏游戏界面创建房间，或用房间号和邀请凭据预览后加入。可选择三人或四人，以及经典或癞子玩法。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/HostApp.tsx:114"]}
{"unit_id":"lifefloating__dsh-doudizhu#feature-feature-2","repo":"lifefloating/dsh-doudizhu","commit":"06dab1c528542f92f63a6733806f03877f33293f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-poker 的「斗地主牌局」功能：房间内按叫抢地主、加倍和轮流出牌推进牌局，支持经典牌型比较及癞子规则，完成后计算本局结算。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/engine/play.ts:62"]}
{"unit_id":"lifefloating__dsh-doudizhu#feature-feature-3","repo":"lifefloating/dsh-doudizhu","commit":"06dab1c528542f92f63a6733806f03877f33293f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-poker 的「好友邀请与观战」功能：房间生成房号和邀请链接，玩家加入时可选择入座或观战；配置对外地址后可供其他设备访问。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/room/RoomManager.ts:173"]}
{"unit_id":"lifefloating__dsh-doudizhu#feature-feature-4","repo":"lifefloating/dsh-doudizhu","commit":"06dab1c528542f92f63a6733806f03877f33293f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-poker 的「欢迎积分与结算」功能：为玩家维护本机房间积分账本，入座时冻结积分，并在牌局结束后记录结算；积分与 DeepSeek 平台余额分离。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/settle/ledger.ts:15"]}
{"unit_id":"lifefloating__dsh-doudizhu#feature-feature-5","repo":"lifefloating/dsh-doudizhu","commit":"06dab1c528542f92f63a6733806f03877f33293f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-poker 的「超时托管」功能：牌局计时到期后按自动策略进行叫抢或打出可行牌，玩家再次操作即可退出托管。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/engine/play.ts:9"]}
{"unit_id":"lifefloating__dsh-doudizhu#caveat-1","repo":"lifefloating/dsh-doudizhu","commit":"06dab1c528542f92f63a6733806f03877f33293f","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-poker 的邀请二维码会把完整房间邀请 URL 作为参数请求 api.qrserver.com 生成图片；跨设备加入还需将 publicBaseUrl 配成可访问的 HTTP(S) origin。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/InviteDialog.tsx:38-46","src/client/SettingsCard.tsx:171-180"]}
